🔑 List each distinct attribute key and received kind once, with the locations where it occurs. Searches all signals and owners in the last hour and returns up to 25 key/kind pairs. Narrow by signal, owner or both.

USAGE
  otel-desktop-viewer attributes keys [flags]

EXAMPLES
  otel-desktop-viewer attributes keys
  otel-desktop-viewer attributes keys --signal logs --owner-type log --service checkout --since 30m --json
  otel-desktop-viewer attributes keys --signal metrics --owner-type scope --json

FLAGS
      --end string          Inclusive RFC3339 end time (nanoseconds supported)
      --endpoint string     Running viewer HTTP endpoint (default "http://localhost:8000")
      --json                Emit exact JSON with truncation instead of columns
      --limit int           Maximum rows to return (default 25)
      --owner-type string   Limit to one owner: span/event/link (traces), log (logs), datapoint/exemplar/metadata (metrics), resource or scope
      --service string      Only records for this service
      --signal string       Limit to one signal: traces, logs or metrics
      --since duration      Relative lookback window (for example 30m, 6h, or 24h) (default 1h0m0s)
      --start string        Inclusive RFC3339 start time (nanoseconds supported)

GLOBAL FLAGS
  -h, --help   Help for this command
